|YK0
The Monkey is a creature whose only true peers are humans.
They have incredibly powerful acrobatic skills that can cause
great pains and leave opponents stunned.

This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Monkey.

These powers are: |GKBMonkey Whip|YK0, |GKBMonkey Slam|YK0, |GKBStudy|YK0
and |GKBMonkey Driver|YK0.
